[I] A blazingly fast Slack TUI

[T] A blazingly fast Slack TUI. Keyboard-driven, beautifully themed, and
[T] under 20MB. One static binary. No Electron required.

[U] https://github.com/gammons/slk

[A] Grant Ammons <grant@grant.dev>
